  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><span class=\"wikipopup hide\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stance\" title=\"Stance\">Stance</a>. For 7 seconds, Shiro's <a href=\"/wiki/Attack\" title=\"Attack\">attacks</a> gain <a href=\"/wiki/Life_stealing\" title=\"Life stealing\">life stealing</a> equal to the highest <a href=\"/wiki/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> he takes while in this stance.</span></p><div class=\"infobox skill-box Monster Monster\">\n<p class=\"skill-name heading\"><b>Battle Scars</b></p>\n<div class=\"skill-details-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"skill-image\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Battle_Scars.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"1274\"><img alt=\"1274\" src=\"/images/9/90/Battle_Scars.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"skill-stats\">\n<ul><li>11 <a href=\"/wiki/Recharge_time\" title=\"Recharge\"><img alt=\"Recharge\" src=\"/images/f/f4/Tango-recharge-darker.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a></li></ul>\n</div></div>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Profession\" title=\"Profession\">Profession</a></dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/Monster\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Monster\">Monster</a></dd>\n<dt><a href=\"/wiki/Special_skill\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Special skill\">Special</a></dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/Monster_skill\" title=\"Monster skill\">Monster skill</a></dd>\n<dt><a href=\"/wiki/Skill_type\" title=\"Skill type\">Type</a></dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/Stance\" title=\"Stance\">Stance</a></dd>\n<dt><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a></dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/Factions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Factions\">Factions</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Stance\" title=\"Stance\">Stance</a>. For 7 seconds, Shiro's <a href=\"/wiki/Attack\" title=\"Attack\">attacks</a> gain <a href=\"/wiki/Life_stealing\" title=\"Life stealing\">life stealing</a> equal to the highest <a href=\"/wiki/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> he takes while in this stance.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<dl><dt>Concise description</dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\nStance. (7 seconds.) Shiro's attacks gain life stealing equal to the highest damage he takes while in this stance.</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Battle_Scars&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Notes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>This skill is used by <a href=\"/wiki/Shiro_Tagachi\" title=\"Shiro Tagachi\">Shiro Tagachi</a>.</li>\n<li>Because this is a <a href=\"/wiki/Stance\" title=\"Stance\">stance</a>, skills such as <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Blow\" title=\"Wild Blow\">Wild Blow</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Strike\" title=\"Wild Strike\">Wild Strike</a> can remove it.</li>\n<li>Shiro almost always <a href=\"/wiki/Stance_cancel\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stance cancel\">stance cancels</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Riposting_Shadows\" title=\"Riposting Shadows\">Riposting Shadows</a> with this.</li>\n<li>The <i>highest damage</i> refers to the highest damage <a href=\"/wiki/Packet\" title=\"Packet\">packet</a> he takes while in this stance.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"margin: 1em; border: solid silver; border-width: 1px 0px; padding: 2px 1em 2px 7.5em;\"><strong class=\"hiddenlinks\" style=\"position: absolute; margin-left: -7.3em; color: #900;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Anomaly.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Anomaly\"><img alt=\"Anomaly\" src=\"/images/thumb/a/a6/Anomaly.png/18px-Anomaly.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/a6/Anomaly.png/27px-Anomaly.png 1.5x, /images/a/a6/Anomaly.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"32\" data-file-height=\"32\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Anomaly\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Anomaly\">Anomaly</a>.</strong>Similar to Shiro's other skills, the descriptions do not mention that this skill cannot be <a href=\"/wiki/Disable\" title=\"Disable\">disabled</a>.</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261009080034\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 285/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2439/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 818/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 7/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.762      1 -total\n 83.00%   11.423      1 Template:Skill_infobox\n 42.71%    5.878      1 Template:Ifexists\n 16.04%    2.208      1 Template:Anomaly\n 14.64%    2.014      1 Template:Extension_DPL\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key en_wiki:pcache:idhash:21036-0!canonical and timestamp 20261009080034 and revision id 2692299.\n -->\n</div>"
